# Parameterized function type expression: [Identity: [type [let a] [Fn@a [a]]]]
# is an identity-function type where param and return are the same type.
# [@[Identity Integer]] expands to [Fn@Integer [Integer]] — enforces identity contract.
[
  Identity: [type [let a] [Fn@a [a]]]
  id: [@[Identity Integer] [fn [let v] v]]
  result: [id 99]
]
=== out
Dict({"Identity": Dict({}), "id": Function(v), "result": Int(99)})
